5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to check who actually carries the load here.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to know what living next to this is like daily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Nobody has added up the costs yet. That worries me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,We still have to live together. Let's keep it friendly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I need to know the time cost in hours, not just money.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, do you have any numbers on the budget?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, time is money too. Let's look at both.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the ledger and the subsidy.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look at the complaint log and the frontages.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I'll check the supervised mornings and the truck time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I'll look at the ward filing and the station minutes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the bin house visit and the residents' statements.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Agreed. Let's get the facts before we argue.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Yes, facts first. Then we can talk.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
