35,2,1,talk,May,,The filing takes four months and five signatures. That's a lot.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The bin house smells worse in summer. That's a dealbreaker.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The subsidy only covers forty percent. We pay the rest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,Eleven complaints came from one house. That's a red flag.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The truck comes at seven forty. That's very early for some.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, forty percent is not enough. Who pays the rest?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, if one house is so unhappy, rotation might help.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,The frontages are uneven. One is very narrow.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Twenty supervised mornings a year is manageable, I think.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The station block argued over the latch within two years.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,Three people said they wouldn't turn away late bags.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,So a managed hour might fail if people don't enforce it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Rotation seems fairer, but the narrow frontage is a problem.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must consider the human cost of enforcement.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I lean towards rotation, but we need a plan for the narrow spot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Enclosed structure is out. The smell is too bad.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree. The cost is too high for the benefit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let's vote. I think rotation is the best compromise.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I concur. Let us move to the vote.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
